3. PERMITTED PURPOSES (FOR CLARITY)

    Personal study, classroom/academic learning, self-directed security
    research, responsible disclosure, and non-commercial sharing among learners
    remain fully permitted under Section 1.


4. ADDITIONAL TERMS

    These terms are appended to, and do NOT replace, Sections 1–3. In case of
    conflict, the more restrictive term governs.

    A. Academic Integrity
       I hereby declare that all online courses involved in this
       reverse-engineering research were genuinely and completely studied by
       me, with NO single lesson skipped. Should any omission or uncompleted
       study-time be found later, I commit to making it up.

    B. No Record-Forging
       This work MUST NOT be used to evade, forge, or tamper with online-course
       assessment, study-time, or grade records.

    C. Responsible Disclosure
       If this research is proven effective, the user MUST submit — through
       lawful and legitimate channels — the COMPLETE original materials
       (reverse-engineering process, reproduction steps, source files, packet
       captures) so the affected party may assess and remediate, and MUST NOT
       disclose any bypass details during a reasonable remediation period.
       Recommended: the vendor's Security Response Center (SRC), official
       feedback channels, or a school / research cooperation track.

    D. Compliance with Law and Ethics
       Use MUST comply with all applicable laws, regulations, and
       academic-integrity norms, including but not limited to the Cybersecurity
       Law and the Data Security Law of the People's Republic of China, and the
       platform's Terms of Service. The user bears SOLE responsibility for any
       unlawful or unethical use.

    E. Prior Authorization (Strongly Recommended)
       Before reverse-engineering, probing, or security-testing any live
       system, you are STRONGLY encouraged to first submit a formal, written
       authorization request to the operator and proceed only after approval.
       Unsanctioned probing may violate applicable law or terms of service.

    F. AI-Generated Content Notice
       This research contains code, text, and analysis assisted or generated by
       artificial intelligence (AI). The author has carefully reviewed and
       verified it; however, AI tools may produce errors, hallucinations, or
       inaccurate conclusions, so users SHOULD INDEPENDENTLY RE-VALIDATE any
       content — especially security findings, interface parameters, algorithm
       details, and reproduction steps — before relying on it. The author
       assumes no responsibility for the absolute accuracy or completeness of
       AI-generated content. This notice does not limit any disclaimer below.


